OL,3,GNEWSAMan who posed as medical student
OL,4,Aat hospital fails to appear for
OL,5,Asentencing
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are searching for a man who
OL,8,Fgained access to hospital wards and
OL,9,Fpatients' files for several weeks while
OL,10,Fpretending to be a medical student,
OL,11,Fafter he failed to appear for
OL,12,Fsentencing.
OL,14,FStephen Simpson previously admitted
OL,15,Fcarrying out the fraud at Aberdeen
OL,16,FRoyal Infirmary (ARI) between 9
OL,17,FDecember 2023 and 26 January 2024.
OL,19,FThe 22-year-old accessed the hospital
OL,20,Fwhile wearing medical scrubs, NHS
OL,21,Fbranded clothing, a stethoscope and a
OL,22,Fpager.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
